another consumer that listens to:        mvn -Pconsumer -DtopicName="hello.world.hungray" -Dwildcard=".*"        And when you type a message on this prompt, you should see it in the first consumer you started  </Data><Data Name='User'>EC2AMAZ-I41BETP\Administrator</Data></EventData></Event>
